 & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=R_3-2R_2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing $R_3:=\\frac{1}{3}R_3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nThe matrix is in row echelon form: each pivot lies to the right of the pivot above it, with zeros below each pivot.\n\nThe corresponding triangular system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y+2z&=0 \\\\ y-z&=0 \\\\ z&=3\\end{aligned}\\right..\n$$\n\nBack substitution gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z&=3 \\\\ y&=0-(-1)(3)=3 \\\\ x&=0-(-1)(3)-(2)(3)=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $\\langle -3,3,3\\rangle$." 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760774 1080 "x=3,\\quad y=-1,\\quad z=3" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760774 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760774 1083 #uuid "573378c5-f245-5097-b35d-3b415d2e3b71" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760775 1080 "\\langle -20,-5,4\\rangle" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760775 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760775 1083 #uuid "576b49ef-08d6-509a-a339-7db9696407f1" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760776 1080 "x=-5,\\quad y=-2,\\quad z=2" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760776 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760776 1083 #uuid "58f539d7-bad5-5450-b323-f58cfc237d62" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760777 1080 "\\langle 0,0,-2\\rangle" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760777 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760777 1083 #uuid "5e81b2ae-7b06-5bae-85fd-7a11cd6e16f4" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760778 1080 "x=2,\\quad y=1,\\quad z=-3" 13194139547564 17592186576411 true] [17592186760778 1082 #edb/ref 175921